No game data in this repository
-------------------------------
This repository is meant to contain no Azure Dreams game data: no disc image,
no executable, no overlay or file extracted from the disc, and no copy of the
retail binary bytes. What it does contain is our own work:

  * reconstructed C source (src/, include/) written to compile to the same
    bytes as the retail code. These files describe the behaviour of Konami's
    program; some of them (const tables, jump tables, string data) express small
    pieces of game data as C. No rights in that underlying material are
    claimed or granted by this project.
  * tools, build scripts, configuration, documentation, names and notes.
  * hashes and byte counts used to check a build against the retail files.

To build or verify anything you must supply your own legally obtained copy of
the game (see README.md). Nothing here is meant to help anyone obtain the game
without owning it.

